 "c": [
  {"i":4451,"t":["clothing","colours"],"s":{"3":["character"]},"n":"がら is taught as the pattern on clothes or fabric (この柄のシャツ). Sense 3 (柄が悪い) gets a character entry. Physique mostly appears in 大柄/小柄, which are separate words, so no body entry."},
  {"i":4454,"t":["measures","home"],"n":"Learners mainly meet 階 as the floor counter (〜階), so measures comes first and home second."},
  {"i":4466,"t":["thinking","science"],"n":"確率 is mostly used for everyday chances (確率が高い, 降水確率), so the possibility sense leads. The maths term comes second."},
  {"i":4478,"t":["actions","feelings"],"n":"大騒ぎ(する) is making a fuss, driven by excitement or alarm. It is not a describing word, so qualities does not fit."},
  {"i":4479,"t":["thinking","actions"],"n":"The core is ascertaining or seeing something through to the end, which is thinking. Watching it with one's own eyes is a real secondary action sense."},
  {"i":4492,"t":["colours","clothing"],"s":{"2":["qualities"],"5":["weather"]},"n":"The main sense is a pattern or design, often on clothes (水玉模様). The state sense goes only in its own entry, and 雨模様 goes to weather."},
  {"i":4509,"t":["family","people"],"n":"The birth of a child belongs in the family unit and with life stages. 誕生日 is its own word, so neither festivals nor calendar fits."},
  {"i":4511,"t":["law","sports"],"s":{"2":["feelings"]},"n":"Drowning is taught under water safety and emergencies, and with swimming. Nature is a loose association. The figurative 酒に溺れる sense stays as a feelings entry."},
  {"i":4531,"t":["colours"],"s":{"3":["character"]},"n":"丸い belongs with shapes. The common use 性格が丸い/丸くなる describes personality, so sense 3 needs a character entry."},
  {"i":4548,"t":["qualities"],"n":"恵まれる describes a fortunate state (blessed with talent or good weather). It is not an emotion."},
  {"i":4593,"t":["arts","actions"],"s":{"2":["culture"]},"n":"Applause is an action at performances, and body comes only from the picture. Clapping at a shrine (二礼二拍手一礼) is taught with customs."},
  {"i":4596,"t":["actions","communication"],"n":"封印 is mostly sealing something up or away, which is an action. Sealing letters is the secondary use."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":4451,"keep":[3],"n":"柄が悪い/柄じゃない for someone's nature is common; a teacher would cover it with personality"},
  {"i":4453,"keep":[3],"n":"Recycling sense (再生紙, 再生可能エネルギー) is common and taught with the environment; resuscitation is too advanced"},
  {"i":4462,"keep":[],"n":"Offering tea or a seat is still a communication use; no separate food lesson for it"},
  {"i":4465,"keep":[4],"n":"時計の針 is very common and taught when reading clock time"},
  {"i":4475,"keep":[],"n":"The depressed sense mostly appears as 塞ぎ込む/気が塞ぐ and is not core at this level"},
  {"i":4492,"keep":[],"n":"At this level 模様 means pattern; the state and likely-rain senses live in compounds like 空模様/雨模様 or news style"},
  {"i":4511,"keep":[],"n":"Indulge/addicted is a figurative sense and not an emotion-unit word"},
  {"i":4524,"keep":[2],"n":"料理やお酒を振る舞う is a common use and fits hosting and food"},
  {"i":4531,"keep":[3],"n":"性格が丸くなる/人が丸い for a mellow personality is common and fits character"},
  {"i":4572,"keep":[4],"n":"友達の輪/人の輪 is common for a circle of people; wheel is normally 車輪, so transport is dropped"},
  {"i":4574,"keep":[2],"n":"丸一日/丸ごと meaning whole or entire is common and fits quantity words"},
  {"i":4593,"keep":[],"n":"Shrine clapping is usually written 柏手 and is rare for learners"}
 ]
